sy to sign-up and requires no technical knowledge. Affiliate programs are common throughout the Internet and offer website owners an additional way to profit from their websites. Affiliates generate traffic and sales for commercial websites and in return receive a commission payment.</p>\r\n<h2>How Does It Work?</h2>\r\n<p>When you join our affiliate program, you will be supplied with a custom id that you can use to link to any page on marcobucciartstore.com. When a user clicks on one of your custom links, a cookie will be saved in their browser. When that user purchases something from the Marco Bucci Art store, you will receive a commission based on your commission type. Our cookies last for 30 days.</p>",
